    "Description": "rhc is a client tool and daemon that connects the system to Red Hat hosted services enabling system and subscription management.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* golang.org/x/text: golang.org/x/text: Denial of Service via invalid UTF-8 input (CVE-2026-56852)\n\n* google.golang.org/grpc: gRPC-Go: Denial of Service via malformed RPC requests (CVE-2026-84445)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
